---
name: a-share-limit-up-predictor
description: Screen Shanghai and Shenzhen A-shares around 14:20 and 14:50 China Standard Time and estimate next-trading-day limit-up probability, optional expected return, and buyability for qualifying emerging-industry stocks. Use for first-board and higher continuation research and backtesting; not for execution or guaranteed predictions.
